  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE:**__\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ffa26d5dd542291d735e13bceda0e5c6b162b8fcf4320e8d77e67229e1f37849.png] \n\n**GIVEN: 48 ÷ 12 × 3 + 5 - 4 = 21**\n\n**Option (1):** ÷ and ×\n\nInterchanging the signs ÷ and ×, interchanged equation is\n\n48 × __**12 ÷ 3**__ + 5 - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ __**48 × 4 **__+ 5 - 4 = 21\n\n⇒__** **____**192 + 5**__ - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ 197 - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ **193 ≠ 21**\n\n⇒** ****LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (2)****:** - and ÷\n\nInterchanging the signs - and ÷, interchanged equation is\n\n48 - 12 × 3 +__** 5 ÷ 4**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 48 - __**12 × 3**__ + 1.25 = 21\n\n⇒** 48** - 36 **+ 1.25 **= 21\n\n⇒ __**48 + 1.25**__ - 36 = 21\n\n⇒ 49.25 - 36 = 21\n\n⇒** 13.25 ≠ 21**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (3):** × and +\n\nInterchanging the signs × and +, interchanged equation is\n\n__**48 ÷ 12 **__+ 3 × 5 - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ 4 + __**3 ×**____** 5**__ - 4 = 21\n\n⇒__** 4 + 15**__ - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ 19 - 4 = 21\n\n⇒ **15 ≠ 21**\n\n⇒** LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (4):** - and ×\n\nInterchanging the signs - and ×, interchanged equation is\n\n__**48 ÷ 12**__ - 3 + 5 × 4 = 21\n\n⇒ 4 - 3 + __**5 ×**____** 4**__ = 21\n\n⇒** 4** - 3 **+ 20 **= 21\n\n⇒ __**4 + 20 **__- 3 = 21\n\n⇒ 24 - 3 = 21\n\n⇒** 21 = 21**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"option (4)\".**",
